{"availability":"available","full":"monashcoding/monmap","name":"monmap","description":"Course mapper for Monash students, meant to replace MonPlan (which was sunset June 2026)","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":9,"forks":3,"created":"2026-04-20T22:30:31Z","updated":"2026-09-05T04:39:11Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://monmap.monashcoding.com","topics":[],"demo":"https://monmap.monashcoding.com/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T21:19:18.676Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T21:19:18.676Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-03T21:19:18.676Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T21:19:18.676Z","stars":9,"forks":3}],"technologies":[],"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T09:39:09.483Z","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A course planner for Monash students, built by the Monash Association of Coding.","Meant to replace MonPlan, which is being sunset on 2 June 2026.","MonMap lets you drag units onto a year-by-year grid and see, in real time, whether your plan actually works. It checks prereqs and slot offerings against the actual Monash handbook, flags what doesn't fit, surfaces what's missing from your course requirements, and keeps a running WAM as you tweak. Sign in to save plans across devices, or use it anonymously and export to JSON."],"features":["Quick unit search. Two-pane layout with slot-fit hints and a","recent-units rail so common picks are one click away.","Plans you own. Export, re-import, print, or share. Your data","Faithful handbook coverage. Cross-year prereqs, honours track","variations, and the trickier offering rules are all modelled explicitly."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/monashcoding/monmap/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"0f4d8a5337654bcbbe99eec1e9f0fc7e0e5f1fd377fe561c8006bd464d96bd75","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T06:15:19.571Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T09:39:09.481Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-05T04:39:11Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A